  Root cause: a single EOL parent. Spring Boot 3.1.x went out of OSS support and stopped
  receiving the managed-dependency bumps, so every transitive CVE above accumulated behind
  one version number. This was tracked as deferred follow-up #8 as a currency concern; the
  dependency scan reclassifies it as a Layer-1 CRITICAL.

FIX: spring-boot-starter-parent 3.1.5 -> 3.5.3, plus
